<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="ko">
<head>
<meta charset="utf-8">
<meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1">
<title>{{ note.title }} — AI 트레이딩 강의</title>
<link rel="stylesheet" href="{{ css_path }}">
</head>
<body>
<div class="topbar">
  <a class="home" href="{{ index_path }}">전체 목차</a>
  <span class="crumb">Part {{ "%02d"|format(note.part) }} · CH{{ "%02d"|format(note.chapter) }}. {{ note.chapter_title }}</span>
</div>

<div class="wrap">
  <header class="note-head">
    <div class="kicker">Part {{ "%02d"|format(note.part) }}. {{ note.part_title }}</div>
    <h1>{{ note.title }}</h1>
    <div class="badges">
      <span class="badge time">약 {{ note.duration }}분</span>
      {% if note.practice %}
      <span class="badge practice">{{ note.practice }}</span>
      {% else %}
      <span class="badge theory">이론·데모</span>
      {% endif %}
    </div>
  </header>

  <main>
    {{ content }}
  </main>

  <nav class="pager">
    {% if prev %}
    <a class="prev" href="{{ prev.href }}"><span class="dir">← 이전 클립</span>{{ prev.title }}</a>
    {% endif %}
    {% if next %}
    <a class="next" href="{{ next.href }}"><span class="dir">다음 클립 →</span>{{ next.title }}</a>
    {% endif %}
  </nav>

  <footer class="site">
    코딩 몰라도 완성하는 나만의 AI 알고리즘 트레이딩 시스템 w. Claude Code · 본 자료는 교육 목적이며 투자 권유가 아닙니다.
  </footer>
</div>

<script>
document.querySelectorAll("pre").forEach(function (pre) {
  var btn = document.createElement("button");
  btn.className = "copy-btn";
  btn.textContent = "복사";
  btn.addEventListener("click", function () {
    var code = pre.querySelector("code");
    navigator.clipboard.writeText(code ? code.innerText : pre.innerText).then(function () {
      btn.textContent = "복사됨!";
      setTimeout(function () { btn.textContent = "복사"; }, 1500);
    });
  });
  pre.appendChild(btn);
});
</script>
</body>
</html>
